-- PUA - DefenderCheck Execution | T1027.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_pua_defendercheck.yml | NOTA: fallback QRadarAQL_payload_pipeline: campos sem propriedade DSM mapeada são buscados em UTF8(payload) – custo maior, crie custom properties
SELECT * FROM events WHERE devicetype=12 AND ((LOWER("Process Path") LIKE '%\defendercheck.exe' OR LOWER("Process Name") LIKE '%\defendercheck.exe') OR LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%defendercheck%')
